# your-org/nexus-code#1264 R1. Every PR appends to CHANGELOG.md, so two PRs
# merged in sequence conflict on adjacent lines with no semantic conflict at
# all. `merge=union` (a built-in git merge driver) keeps both sides' lines.
# It is ONLY correct for an append-only ledger; do not widen it to a file
# whose lines carry order-dependent meaning.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
